1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Job seekers spend hours reading listings, then receive opaque AI scores.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:35,000
JobPilot is an evidence-first assistant: know why a job fits before you apply.

3
00:00:35,000 --> 00:01:00,000
This no-login demo uses only fictional roles and a fictional candidate.

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Each displayed match links a named requirement to candidate evidence. The score is deterministic and reconciles to 100 visible points.

5
00:01:40,000 --> 00:02:10,000
GPT-5.6 creates a grounded application strategy with requirement and evidence IDs. It does not calculate the score or submit an application.

6
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Codex helped implement the demo, provider abstraction, validation, and release package. Private Local mode remains a Beta privacy-first option.

7
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:45,000
JobPilot helps people decide where to spend limited application time before they apply.
